t":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5CbJgHWgvjyDRw9Sl4BXhg","review_id":"HlVVrJ6REDHGAZ32Gx4Ikg","date":"2015-01-11T20:19:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.947523832321167,"text_excerpt":"I will be concise with this one, peanut butter burger. After scoffing at such a creation I was advised that if ordered and did not care for it I could have something else. Sweat and saltiness of the peanut butter coupled with the savory beefy patty is a winner. This place may also have one of the most extensive tequilla menus I have ever seen. Bartenders/servers are so awesome and really delivered a good expierence. Definitely one of the best burger spots in the city. Lines are usually much better than Port of Call. Oh and the men's room is........unique to say the least"},{"business_id":"5CbJgHWgvjyDRw9Sl4BXhg","review_id":"ryfhYuemUUPcR4H7Cp6hmw","date":"2009-07-23T22:33:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9450811743736267,"text_excerpt":"Peanut butter bacon burger!!! I was craving a good all american burger in Cajun town and then heard about this nifty joint. At the very end of bourbon street the walk was long but well worth it. The peanut butter burger ($9.50) was delicious!. My friend thought it was a tad on the sweet side, but I think of it as a burger with a Thai twist!! The ultimate fusion food :P. Couple that with some draft beer ($2.50 only!), and you have yourself a good meal. The place is pretty tiny, 3 tables and the bar. I ate at the bar and and had a good time checking out the restaurant's impressive tequila selection. The bartender there was saucy and fun ---gave us her personal box of croutons to use as the ..."},{"business_id":"5CbJgHWgvjyDRw9Sl4BXhg","review_id":"4xkiwNhMkmSp6L6WgUdZdQ","date":"2013-01-27T20:17:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9441758394241333,"text_excerpt":"This place was recommended by a server at the Old Absinthe House (thank you, Jess!). Extensive tequila selection, good pours by the servers, but above all, one of the best burgers in New Orleans (no offense, Port of Call). I had the peanut butter and bacon burger, which sounds bad, but is in fact really tasty. A light coating of peanut butter, a mound of crumbled bacon on top, and under it all, a juicy, medium (actually medium, not just \"not well done\") nice sized burger. The side was a baked potato instead of fries, which was a nice change. Definitely going back to try some of their other stuff. Friendly wait staff, too!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5CbJgHWgvjyDRw9Sl4BXhg","photo_id":"z0NImASe6DNDREiIt8NF-Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/z0NImASe6DNDREiIt8NF-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9193201065063477},{"business_id":"5CbJgHWgvjyDRw9Sl4BXhg","photo_id":"lvcqW8OjeqmfP3zzXbk-ww","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lvcqW8OjeqmfP3zzXbk-ww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8798309564590454},{"business_id":"5CbJgHWgvjyDRw9Sl4BXhg","photo_id":"PJZg_7IE_tVFQ7h5jbs-TQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PJZg_7IE_tVFQ7h5jbs-TQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8750587701797485},{"business_id":"5CbJgHWgvjyDRw9Sl4BXhg","photo_id":"aFePllc-iiq6puPmcqbqUQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aFePllc-iiq6puPmcqbqUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8504321575164795},{"business_id":"5C